{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:59:47.570Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2a689f5728d84d4e4c9f43366870ef7a6c4cbace7b276d17f157f019f7a6e975","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's Strategic digests (all in teams/team-strategic/digests) support:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the handoff, and the 5/4 digest says it was reassigned in the CRM that day. The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management of it that day.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, going by the latest digest (9/30) and the 12/1/25 one, which both say \"Gideon's medical account\". The 3/2025 digest called it Nadia's, so that was an older owner.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\" and never name anyone. The 9/30 digest has Nadia volunteering to run a gate-clerk training for QFO, but that doesn't tell us who owns the account. Please check the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nVantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04. Moss's Sunday prep note of 5/3 says \"changes hands tomorrow\", and the 5/4 digest confirms it as effective that day.\n\nThe digests mostly refer to accounts as \"Gideon's\" or \"Nadia's\" rather than by name, so I matched them using each account's description. Orlavine is the one most worth a quick check against the CRM.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:59:52.066Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"fbad0a6b7c43e5d136689f22288e599f98d3ce3287d93ee464857caddd3906bd","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I posted the answer in the #strategic-pod thread. Two of the four owners are firm, one is an inference, and one I couldn't find.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account before the handoff.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he took it over that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, by inference. The 9/30 and 12/1/25 digests both say \"Gideon's medical account\" without naming Orlavine. The March 2025 digest called Orlavine Nadia's, so that owner is out of date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't confirm an owner. The digests call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\" and never name anyone. I told Ruth to check the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\n**Vantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04.** The 5/3 Sunday prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment took effect that day.\n\nThe `accounts/` folder on the share was empty, so I had no CRM or profile data to check against."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
